# Mardi 29 septembre
date: 2026-09-29

## Warm up
2 rounds
  10/8 cal Ergo
  6 Yoga push-up
  3 Inchworm
  6 Knee push-up
  1 Wall walk (hold 10 s)
  10 Ring row | Scap pull

## AMRAP 5'
AMRAP 5:00
  1-2-3 ...
    Wall walk
    Chest-to-bar pull-up (strict)

Intermediate:
  Chest-to-bar pull-up -> Pull-up

Scaled:
  Chest-to-bar pull-up -> 2x Ring row

## For time
For time, teams of 2, cap 25:00, there and back
  50 cal Ergo (split)
  40 Pull-up (split)
  40 cal Ergo (split)
  30 Chest-to-bar pull-up (split)
  30 cal Ergo (split)
  20 Bar muscle-up (split)
  20 cal Ergo (split)
  20 Handstand push-up (strict, split)
  10 cal Ergo (split)
  10 Wall walk (split)

## Renfo
4 rounds
  30 s Side plank ("gauche")
  30 s Side plank ("droite")
  30 s Plank
  Rest 1:00
